    "body": "It's been pointed out to me that this is untrue. This almost has to be untrue since most code that holds the GIL can end up releasing and re-acquiring it, so if it isn't true then almost anything can be deadlock-prone. (I'd already worked this out a while ago but clearly failed to update the docs).",
