                "message": "Remove docs suggestion `with gil` inside a PyMutex is unsafe\n\nIt's been pointed out to me that this is untrue. This almost\nhas to be untrue since most code that holds the GIL can end up\nreleasing and re-acquiring it, so if it isn't true then almost\nanything can be deadlock-prone. (I'd already worked this out\na while ago but clearly failed to update the docs).",
